                {%- comment -%}
                  Klaviyo back-in-stock trigger. Klaviyo's onsite.js (loaded in
                  theme.liquid) opens the signup modal on click and sends the
                  notification email via the existing Klaviyo flow. Initial
                  visibility is rendered server-side; global.js
                  displayOutOfStockNotification() keeps it in sync on variant change.
